{"overview":"داستان سریال کیمیا (با مهرآه شریفی‌نیا در نقش اصلی) تأثیر تغییرات اجتماعی بر روابط خانوادگی را نشان می‌دهد، در حالی که پدر و دختر را در برابر هم قرار می‌دهد؛ دختر خانواده، به نام کیمیا، بسیار پرسشگر و اعتراض‌گر است و کیمیا با پدرش، که یک نظامی، انضباطی و قانون‌پیروی‌کننده است، روبه‌رو می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story of the series Kimia (starring Mehraveh Sharifinia) shows the impact of societal changes on family relationships, pitting a father and daughter against each other; the daughter of the family, named Kimia, is very questioning and protesting, and Kimia is confronted by her father, who is a military, disciplined, and law-abiding person.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":48,"y":2015,"poster":""},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":40,"y":2015,"poster":""},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":""}],"episodes":110,"crew":["Javad Afshar"],"crew_en":[],"countries":[],"cast":[{"name":"مهراوه شریفی‌نیا","role":"Kimia Parsa","photo":"/pj1DAuMxohXSTwcIyGuat5mdkAT.jpg","en":"Mehraveh Sharifinia"},{"name":"پوریا پورسرخ","role":"Arash Mushfeq","photo":"/7EdZ2ayUBXWQjQ1MMCmwjyDAhyi.jpg","en":"Pouria Poursorkh"},{"name":"مهدی پاکدل","role":"Peyman Nekounam","photo":"/puFWMbVKHkjC7UO0Is6Yu7DTaHK.jpg","en":"Mehdi Pakdel"},{"name":"Sogol Tahmasebi","role":"Narges","photo":"/gczkoEjzGk6F9GbJivggq87TYO1.jpg"},{"name":"گلاره عباسی","role":"Farzaneh Moshfeq","photo":"/tQr6ilbhAiukwGJNUUQWLVQDJFg.jpg","en":"Gelare Abbasi"},{"name":"رضا کیانیان","role":"Fereydoun Moshfeq","photo":"/jcB2AtpV5WWa5yBVpfcr6Hn7Ztz.jpg","en":"Reza Kianian"},{"name":"محمدرضا شریفی‌نیا","role":"Homayoun Kamfar","photo":"/1uNmYqH7aSZKRaKXjIZGpWXjmXu.jpg","en":"Mohammadreza Sharifinia"},{"name":"Amirhossein Arman","role":"Shahryar Kamfar","photo":"/dFTizkKQpPHbKyoR2llPRtxsa5s.jpg"},{"name":"Borzoo Arjmand","role":"Keyvan Parsa","photo":"/3Liwh5me1kYnE7O4DmM8cdFIfuN.jpg"},{"name":"صدیقه کیانفر","role":"Mahtab","photo":"/oKiJ0WD